<title>UK: UK March oil output dips to 2.6 mln bpd - Wood Mac.</title>
<headline>UK March oil output dips to 2.6 mln bpd - Wood Mac.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British oil production fell to 2.60 million barrels per day (bpd) in March from 2.625 million in February, consultants Wood Mackenzie said on Friday.</p>
<p>Despite the fall, oil output was still running 40,000 bpd above the levels of March last year.</p>
